# Project: GOSI Opportunities (فرص التأمينات الاجتماعية) — MVP 1 demo

A marketplace inside the GOSI super-app where GOSI-verified retirees give one-hour video sessions to people seeking guidance. We are building a **fully functional demo** of the whole PRD: retiree, seeker, ops and tech journeys, end to end, with real data in Supabase, real video calls (Daily.co), and a **mocked payment provider** only.

## Sources of truth (read before building any feature)
1. `docs/PRD.md`: product behaviour and rules (V4).
2. `docs/DEMO-SPEC.md`: how the demo implements the PRD (routes, screens, personas, demo clock, jobs, seeds). Wins over the PRD for demo mechanics.
3. `docs/BUILD-PLAN.md`: phase order and acceptance criteria.
4. `supabase/migrations/0001_init.sql`: schema. Change the schema only through new numbered migration files.
5. `brand/gosi-brand/SKILL.md`: GOSI brand rules. `reference/super-app/`: screenshots of the real GOSI app to mimic.

## Vocabulary (use exactly these words in UI and code)
- **Retiree** (never "provider", "expert", "mentor", "tutor").
- **Seeker** (code) / user-facing copy speaks to "you".
- **Category** → **Service Type** (two-level taxonomy; never "sector" for the taxonomy; "sector" only means the GOSI employment record field).
- **Operator** / **ops console** (business owner team). **Tech config** is separate and not in the ops console.
- Profile states: Draft, Pending review, Not approved, Active, Paused. Service Type statuses: Pending, Approved, Not approved.
- Money states: Held, Released, Paid out, Refunded.
- Avoid the word "manually" in UI copy.

## Non-negotiables
- English UI only, but keep all strings in `lib/copy.ts`.
- Every business rule uses **app time** (`getAppNow()` / `app_now()`), never `new Date()`/`now()`.
- Every operator, system and tech action writes an `audit_log` row.
- Every status change that affects a person creates a notification (see DEMO-SPEC §10) and broadcasts it live.
- Never show a retiree individual ratings or who rated them. Never show National ID in the ops console.
- Everything is reversible: no delete/deactivate for retirees, only Pause/Restore.
- Seekers must be 18+. Bookings 24h to 30 days ahead, 1 hour, no overlaps.
- When unsure about product behaviour, follow the PRD and leave a `// PRD:` comment citing the section; don't invent features.
